WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,880
Boss, can that bed fit in my room?

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:13,210
Well, yes. My boss is in a good mood, so I won't make it difficult for you to satisfy me. I will do more for the public administration in the future.

3
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,210
no problem.

4
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:20,140
I can also put this bedside table, illustrations, and this rug into my room. Is that okay, boss?

5
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:23,140
Yes, but your room rate will increase by more than 20 cents.

6
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,140
It should.

7
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:30,360
Is this enough joy in the cemetery?

8
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:36,450
No wonder those people in the base like big thighs, and I want them too.

9
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:39,450
When the hotel is upgraded, all these facilities will be put in.
